.SS SELECT LOGICAL ELEMENTS
.sp
The following prints all \fIinstructions\fP, \fIsymbols\fP and \fItypes\fP that
contain \fB\(aqblock\(aq\fP or \fB\(aq.store\(aq\fP in their names or types, using a tab
layout and given the number of matches.
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
llvm\-debuginfo\-analyzer \-\-attribute=level
                        \-\-select\-nocase \-\-select\-regex
                        \-\-select=BLOCK \-\-select=.store
                        \-\-report=list
                        \-\-print=symbols,types,instructions,summary
                        test\-clang.o

Logical View:
[000]           {File} \(aqtest\-clang.o\(aq

[001]           {CompileUnit} \(aqtest.cpp\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqblock\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqblock\(aq
[004]           {Code} \(aqi32.store     12\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqi32.store     20\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqi32.store     24\(aq
[004]           {Code} \(aqi32.store     28\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqi32.store     28\(aq
[003]           {Code} \(aqi32.store8    19\(aq

